               "text": "#### Exercising Feet and Hands\n\nTo reinforce counting, we are going to do an exercise with our feet and hands. Follow the next instructions and see how numbers are connected to us.\n\nChoose the number of times the feet will step or jump, or the hands will clap. Then, choose the speed. Do it yourself with the app.\n\nAlso, if you wish, you can change the skin color of the hands and feet to match your own by going to Menu → Options.",
